{"id":"00620","root":"uni00620_1","name":{"ja":"エレ・アンスタン","en":"Errer Instinct"},"title":null,"displayName":{"ja":"エレ・アンスタン","en":"Errer Instinct"},"aliases":["Elle Anstan"],"element":"Devilish","rarity":4,"rarityLabel":"SR","roles":[],"traits":[],"release":"2022-09-16","limited":false,"characterId":358,"profile":{"ja":"かつてノマドの生体兵器実験で生み出された強化人間。放棄された研究施設の最奥にて、運良く稼働していたカプセルの中で生き残っていた。崩壊しかけた施設の中で長期のコールドスリープ状態から目覚めた彼女だが、記憶障害を起こしており、自分が何者なのか、なぜこんな所にいるのかもわからない。目覚めた以上、ただそこに居ても朽ち果てるだけだと感じた彼女は、施設に残されていた備品や武器を手に取ると、生き残るため、そして自分以外の生存者と出会うために一人荒野を進んでいく。","en":"She was once a genetically enhanced human created in a Nomad bioweapon experiment. She survived in a capsule that was still functional deep within an abandoned research facility. After waking from a long-term cold sleep amid the crumbling complex, she suffers from memory loss and doesn't know who she is or why she's there. Realizing that simply staying put would mean decay, she grabbed whatever supplies and weapons were left behind and set out into the wasteland alone—to survive and to find other survivors."},"illustrator":"さのとしひで","voiceActor":"霜月咲空","forms":[{"id":"uni00620_1","rarity":2,"rarityLabel":"R","levelMax":50,"stats":{"hp":[674,1348],"sp":[150,150],"atk":[133,266],"def":[133,266],"spd":[47,47],"luck":[1,80]},"spCharge":36,"skills":["2","1600009"]},{"id":"uni00620_2","rarity":3,"rarityLabel":"HR","levelMax":60,"stats":{"hp":[948,1896],"sp":[240,240],"atk":[216,432],"def":[216,432],"spd":[47,47],"luck":[1,80]},"spCharge":36,"skills":["2","1600009","1600010"]},{"id":"uni00620_3","rarity":4,"rarityLabel":"SR","levelMax":80,"stats":{"hp":[1222,2445],"sp":[300,300],"atk":[299,599],"def":[299,599],"spd":[47,47],"luck":[1,80]},"spCharge":36,"skills":["2","1600009","1600010"]}],"skills":{"2":{"slot":"attack","id":2,"name":null,"hits":1,"cutin":false,"levels":[{"level":1,"sp":0,"detail":{"ja":"魔性属性ダメージ"}},{"level":2,"sp":0,"detail":{"ja":"魔性属性ダメージ"}},{"level":3,"sp":0,"detail":{"ja":"魔性属性ダメージ"}},{"level":4,"sp":0,"deta